  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2102.02 Information Required.\n\n(a) An affirmative answer to any of the questions on DSSP 260, (revised March 2017) shall require a clarification on the reverse side of the application form so that a determination of the circumstances can be made.\n\n(b) The applicant shall sign DSSP 260 before submitting it to the division of state police. The applicant’s signature shall indicate that the applicant:\n\n(1) Understands that any information provided by the applicant may be investigated as allowed by law;\n\n(2) Consents to the release of information about the applicant’s ability and fitness to carry a pistol or revolver; and\n\n(3) Certifies that all the statements provided on the application are true, correct and complete.\n\nSource. #1911, eff 1-11-82; ss by #2608, eff 1-31-84 EXPIRED: 1-31-90 (formerly Saf-P 502.03)\n\nNew. #4891, eff 7-31-90; ss by #6269, eff 6-25-96; ss by #8104, INTERIM, eff 6-25-04, EXPIRES: 12-22-04; ss by #8189, eff 10-15-04; ss by #10380, eff 7-17-13; ss by #13881, eff 2-20-24",
